  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第九关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "呼......甩开他们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "按这个速度，我们很快就会离开中城区，抵达南面出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "周围也变得越来越嘈杂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "可能是切尔诺伯格的居民想要逃出城市，反而和整合运动发生了冲突吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "似乎有几个城区已经撤离了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "而没来得及逃出切尔诺伯格的本地居民，却依然被整合运动拦在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "这个开阔区域，曾经是个大广场吧。如今......只剩下些废墟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "虐待感染者的城市，遭到了感染者的报复吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "你似乎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "很有感触。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "呵，曾经......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "天色......越来越暗淡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "好像连空气中......都弥漫着一股......燃烧的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们在干什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "平民",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......啊啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "————!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "平民？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "听不到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "——这个距离，没法确认身份。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "整合运动在攻击他们——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "在这种地形没有优势。我们没有能力去顾及他人的生命安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "生命很宝贵，阿米娅。每个人的，都很宝贵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "不管怎么样都来不及了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "毕竟我们已经有更大的麻烦找上了门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "不好的事情还是发生了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "——————杀了他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "临光",
      "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
      "text": "开阔区各个出口同时出现大量整合运动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "准备作战！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
